# Top-level Python packages for the local Google Fonts build, report, and
# package-review workflow. Keep this list small; requirements.txt is the
# pinned install snapshot generated from the active local .venv.
# Proofs and specimen images use DesignBot (installed separately).
# fgtools is the shared tooling of Font.Garden projects, pinned to a
# commit.
fontmake
fonttools
gftools
diffenator3
ufo2ft
gflanguages
gfsubsets
axisregistry
opentype-sanitizer
GitPython
glyphsets
PyYAML
uharfbuzz
fgtools @ git+https://github.com/fontgarden/fgtools@98f9db3bfb71b6465e15969f11532c3ae185e938
